        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- I once again revised and expanded the section on gender-inclusive language in Lesson 1. This treatment was substantially revised for the twelfth edition, but our society's discourse on gender has progressed so much in even the past few years that another revision was needed. The book now also takes up the issue of gender-inclusive language from an ethical perspective in Lesson 11.",
            "block_bbox": [
                105,
